# Formalism: Fractint-style context-free turtle string
# Parse    : pass; validator=corpus-static
# Execute  : pass; engine=bounded-python-context-free; iterations=3
# Render   : pass; file=../renders/pinetree--61107c24e3.svg
# Fidelity : equivalent
# Features : bracketed, context-free, deterministic, fractint-turtle
# Angle    : 20
# Heading  : 0
# Draw     : F D
# Move     : G M
